    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Selkie Warden · уровень 3</b></p><p>Your Hunter’s Mark manifests as an inexorable pull toward the deep. While a creature is marked by your<br>Hunter’s Mark:<br>• Its Speed is reduced by 10 feet, and it cannot benefit from effects that increase its Speed.<br>• If the marked creature willingly moves 10+ feet, it takes<br>Cold damage equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of 1) once per turn.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Скорость цели, добровольность 10 ft и предел 1/ход — вручную.</li></ul>"
